{#
Kustomize name-reference configuration for the llm-d v1.0+ `DisaggregatedSet`.

Kustomize ships reference mappings for built-in kinds only, so `namePrefix`
renames the guide's ServiceAccount without rewriting
`spec.roles[].spec.leaderWorkerTemplate.workerTemplate.spec.serviceAccountName`.
The list path without indices applies to every role, as the guide's own
`labels` entries demonstrate. Loaded by the overlay's `configurations:`.
#}
nameReference:
  - kind: ServiceAccount
    version: v1
    fieldSpecs:
      - path: spec/roles/spec/leaderWorkerTemplate/workerTemplate/spec/serviceAccountName
        kind: DisaggregatedSet
        group: disaggregatedset.x-k8s.io
        version: v1
